      "mergeID": "6296974db6d8de0b6d04ef7e",
      "mergedPostDetails": "As what i have seen this update is not ideal, The shoulders still have locomotion, the torso twists and turns in god awful ways, my viewpoint will move at times when i bend down, I don't like this new update, i hope things fix.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "IK 2.0 Problems",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "621971f5d45db0462284f5df",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It sounds like all of your issues are related to the base layer animation playing under your IK. This can be solved by making a custom AV3 base layer better suited to FBT, but it sounds like what you want is an option that doesn't require customizing your avatar. There's already a canny post for that, so I'll merge this one in to there. If you feel that you have a different issue, feel free to make a new canny post with those specifics.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
